  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "SLA Compliance Overview",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 2, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## SLA Compliance Dashboard\n\n**4 SLOs tracked** | Refresh: 10s | Timezone: ET\n\n| SLO | Target | Window | Error Budget |\n|-----|--------|--------|-------------|\n| API Availability | 99.9% | 30d | 43.2 min/month |\n| API Latency (p99) | < 200ms | 30d | 0.1% requests |\n| Ingestion Uptime | 99% | market hours | 39 min/day |\n| WS Delivery | 99.99% | 30d | 4.32 min/month |"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "API Availability % (24h)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 2 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg_over_time(up{job=\"floww-oracle\"}[24h]) * 100",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 99.5 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 99.9 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background"
      }
    },
